  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young Drive Academy - Entrepreneurship in Botswanaplanning grant - Young Drive Academy - Entrepreneurship in Botswana</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Young Drive Academy - Entrepren&#xf6;rskap i Botswana, planeringsbidrag</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det f&#xf6;reslagna planeringsbidraget ska finansiera genomf&#xf6;randet av ett pilotprojekt som ska testa ett koncept som tidigare genomf&#xf6;rts i      Sverige under namnet Young Driver Academy och syftar till att         stimulera ungt entrepren&#xf6;rskap. I f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngningen &#xe4;r f&#xf6;rhoppningen att  konceptet genom ett vidare arbete ska kunna implementeras i Botswana  och vara ett steg mot en diversifierad ekonomi.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed planning grant will finance the implementation of a      pilot project to test a concept that has previously been carried out  in Sweden under the name Young Driver Academy. The programme aims to  stimulate young entrepreneurship. Ultimately it is hoped that the     concept through a further work will be implemented in Botswana and be a step towards a diversified economy.</narrative>
  </description>
